Q: Parsing a field into multiple records A: <p>Instead of flat *.csv files you can request the same data in XML format. XML is inherently hierarchical. After that it is very easy to load it into the appropriate database tables. No need to deal with complicated T-SQL: pivots, splitting, grouping, etc.</p>
<pre><code>&lt;Accounts&gt;
  &lt;Account&gt;
    &lt;ACCOUNTID&gt;AC30400290&lt;/ACCOUNTID&gt;
    &lt;Record&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_CD&gt;01&lt;/PROGRAM_CD&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_AMT&gt;25000&lt;/PROGRAM_AMT&gt;
    &lt;/Record&gt;
    &lt;Record&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_CD&gt;02&lt;/PROGRAM_CD&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_AMT&gt;40411&lt;/PROGRAM_AMT&gt;
    &lt;/Record&gt;
    &lt;Record&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_CD&gt;04&lt;/PROGRAM_CD&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_AMT&gt;30730&lt;/PROGRAM_AMT&gt;
    &lt;/Record&gt;
    &lt;Record&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_CD&gt;17&lt;/PROGRAM_CD&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_AMT&gt;30730&lt;/PROGRAM_AMT&gt;
    &lt;/Record&gt;
  &lt;/Account&gt;
  &lt;Account&gt;
    &lt;ACCOUNTID&gt;AC01410304&lt;/ACCOUNTID&gt;
    &lt;Record&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_CD&gt;02&lt;/PROGRAM_CD&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_AMT&gt;65100&lt;/PROGRAM_AMT&gt;
    &lt;/Record&gt;
    &lt;Record&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_CD&gt;22&lt;/PROGRAM_CD&gt;
      &lt;PROGRAM_AMT&gt;48401&lt;/PROGRAM_AMT&gt;
    &lt;/Record&gt;
  &lt;/Account&gt;
&lt;/Accounts&gt;

</code></pre>

Q: Issue resolving dependencies with Maven in intellij A: <p>as life888888 showed my issue was one of formatting. I had nested both of my dependencies inside the same <code>&lt;dependencyManagement&gt;</code> block.</p>
<p>by separating them into</p>
<pre><code>&lt;dependencyManagement&gt; 
    &lt;dependencies&gt; 
        &lt;dependency&gt; 
            &lt;groupId&gt;org.mongodb&lt;/groupId&gt; 
            &lt;artifactId&gt;mongodb-driver-bom&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;5.6.4&lt;/version&gt;
            &lt;type&gt;pom&lt;/type&gt; 
            &lt;scope&gt;import&lt;/scope&gt; 
        &lt;/dependency&gt; 
    &lt;/dependencies&gt; 
&lt;/dependencyManagement&gt;

&lt;dependencies&gt; 
    &lt;dependency&gt; 
        &lt;groupId&gt;org.mongodb&lt;/groupId&gt; 
        &lt;artifactId&gt;mongodb-driver-sync&lt;/artifactId&gt; 
    &lt;/dependency&gt; 
&lt;/dependencies&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>I was able to solve the issue.</p>
